      "evidence_quote": "Robyn Ellis paid the charity £260 on 4 February 2026. The bookkeeping sheet calls it a donation, but January emails show she accepted a £260 price for advertising her grooming salon in the charity's newsletter and on its website. The booking was confirmed after her payment, and the advertisement appeared as agreed.",
